{
  "id": "kings_marn_talk",
  "start": "greet",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "greet",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "A stall on the market square with a board, a case of rolls and a man ruling a line with the concentration of a surgeon."
        },
        {
          "text": "“Copying is by the sheet and I do not do it while you wait.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "kings_marn_maps",
          "text": "The Library keeps the city's drains, doesn't it?",
          "requires": {
            "without": {
              "lore": [
                "kings_under_maps"
              ]
            }
          },
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "check": {
            "skill": "persuasion",
            "difficulty": {
              "sub": [
                15,
                {
                  "clamp": [
                    {
                      "div": [
                        {
                          "ref": "reputation.the_library",
                          "else": 0
                        },
                        5
                      ]
                    },
                    -6,
                    6
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "onSuccess": "kings_marn_maps_told",
            "onFailure": "kings_marn_maps_wont"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "kings_marn_brick",
          "text": "What is at the third turn under Riverside?",
          "requires": {
            "without": {
              "lore": [
                "kings_under_brick"
              ]
            }
          },
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "check": {
            "skill": "persuasion",
            "difficulty": {
              "sub": [
                13,
                {
                  "clamp": [
                    {
                      "div": [
                        {
                          "ref": "reputation.the_library",
                          "else": 0
                        },
                        5
                      ]
                    },
                    -6,
                    6
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "onSuccess": "kings_marn_brick_told",
            "onFailure": "kings_marn_brick_wont"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "kings_marn_sheet",
          "text": "You copied the sheet before it went. I want your copy.",
          "requires": {
            "without": {
              "items": [
                "drain_sheet"
              ],
              "flags": [
                {
                  "flag": "given:drain_sheet"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": "",
          "check": {
            "skill": "persuasion",
            "difficulty": {
              "sub": [
                16,
                {
                  "clamp": [
                    {
                      "div": [
                        {
                          "ref": "reputation.the_library",
                          "else": 0
                        },
                        5
                      ]
                    },
                    -6,
                    6
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "onSuccess": "kings_marn_sheet_gave",
            "onFailure": "kings_marn_sheet_kept"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "greet_leave",
          "text": "Nothing.",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": [
        {
          "requires": {
            "factions": [
              {
                "faction": "the_library",
                "maxStanding": -25
              }
            ]
          },
          "goto": "kings_marn_cold"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "kings_marn_maps_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“Four hundred years of them, and I copy them for the guilds.” He lowers his voice without seeming to decide to. “There is a year missing out of the run. One sheet. And the run is bound, so somebody cut it out and rebound it, which is a week's work by somebody who knew how.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "learnLore": {
            "entry": "kings_under_maps"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "kings_marn_maps_on",
          "text": "Go on.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "kings_marn_maps_wont",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“I've said all I mean to,” they say, and go back to what they were doing."
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "adjustReputation": {
            "faction": "the_library",
            "amount": -1
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "kings_marn_maps_drop",
          "text": "Leave it.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "kings_marn_brick_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“Brick.” He is precise about it, because he is a copyist. “And I have the profile off my copy — it is a foot thick, English bond, and the mortar is better than anything the city was laying at the time.” He sits back. “Somebody good was in a hurry.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "learnLore": {
            "entry": "kings_under_brick"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "kings_marn_brick_on",
          "text": "Go on.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "kings_marn_brick_wont",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“I've said all I mean to,” they say, and go back to what they were doing."
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "adjustReputation": {
            "faction": "the_library",
            "amount": -1
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "kings_marn_brick_drop",
          "text": "Leave it.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "kings_marn_sheet_gave",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "He does not pretend not to have it. He gets it out of a case and unrolls the corner and rolls it back up again. “I made this the week before. I have never shown it to the Library.” He hands it over. “I would like to not be the only person who has seen it.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "grantItem": {
            "target": {
              "ref": "actor.id"
            },
            "item": "drain_sheet",
            "quantity": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "setFlag": {
            "flag": "given:drain_sheet",
            "value": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "kings_marn_sheet_thanks",
          "text": "Thank you.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "kings_marn_sheet_kept",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“I am a copyist in a city that has already cut one sheet out of a bound run,” he says. “No.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "adjustReputation": {
            "faction": "the_library",
            "amount": -2
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "kings_marn_sheet_leave",
          "text": "Then no.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "kings_marn_cold",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "He rolls what he was working on and puts it in the case and closes the case."
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "kings_marn_go",
          "text": "Leave it.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    }
  ]
}
